      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָה</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo</strong> (principalmente poético e figurado) <strong>buscar refúgio (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَشِىَ</span> iii. é <em>pôr de lado;</em> v. <em>afastar-se, apartar-se;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">حَشًى</span> <em>abrigo, proteção;</em> mas? ش = ס<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:11\" href=\"/Psalms.64.11\">ψ 64:11</a>; 3.ª fem. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָ֫יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:2\" href=\"/Psalms.57.2\">ψ 57:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסִ֫יתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:2\" href=\"/Psalms.7.2\">ψ 7:2</a> + 7 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:40\" href=\"/Psalms.37.40\">ψ 37:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:12\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.12\">Zp 3:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָסָ֫יוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.17\">Dt 32:17</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:9\" href=\"/Psalms.34.9\">ψ 34:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶחְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:4\" href=\"/Psalms.91.4\">ψ 91:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:2\" href=\"/Psalms.57.2\">ψ 57:2</a> (ver Baer <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:9\" href=\"/Psalms.34.9\">ψ 34:9</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחֱסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:3\" href=\"/Psalms.18.3\">ψ 18:3</a> + 2 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱסוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:32\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.32\">Is 14:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱסָיוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:8\" href=\"/Psalms.36.8\">ψ 36:8</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:15\" href=\"/Judges.9.15\">Ju 9:15</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:8\" href=\"/Psalms.118.8\">ψ 118:8</a> + 3 vezes; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.13\">Is 57:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.32\">Pr 14:32</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹסִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:7\" href=\"/Psalms.17.7\">ψ 17:7</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹסְים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.5\">Pr 30:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.31\">2 S 22:31</a> (ver Baer <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.5\">Pr 30:5</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹסֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:12\" href=\"/Psalms.2.12\">ψ 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:12\" href=\"/Psalms.5.12\">5:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹסֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:7\" href=\"/Nahum.1.7\">Na 1:7</a>;—<em>buscar refúgio</em>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>: <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצֵל</span> à sombra de uma árvore <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:15\" href=\"/Judges.9.15\">Ju 9:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצֵל מצרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.2\">Is 30:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:32\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.32\">Is 14:32</a> em Sião, em deuses <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:37\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.37\">Dt 32:37</a> (poema), alhures <em>em Deus</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.3\">2 S 22:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:3\" href=\"/Psalms.18.3\">ψ 18:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:7\" href=\"/Nahum.1.7\">Na 1:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:12\" href=\"/Psalms.2.12\">ψ 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:12\" href=\"/Psalms.5.12\">5:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:2\" href=\"/Psalms.7.2\">7:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:1\" href=\"/Psalms.11.1\">11:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:1\" href=\"/Psalms.16.1\">16:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:20\" href=\"/Psalms.25.20\">25:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:2\" href=\"/Psalms.31.2\">31:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:20\" href=\"/Psalms.31.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:9\" href=\"/Psalms.34.9\">34:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:23\" href=\"/Psalms.34.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:40\" href=\"/Psalms.37.40\">37:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:2\" href=\"/Psalms.57.2\">57:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:11\" href=\"/Psalms.64.11\">64:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:1\" href=\"/Psalms.71.1\">71:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:8\" href=\"/Psalms.118.8\">118:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:9\" href=\"/Psalms.118.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:8\" href=\"/Psalms.141.8\">141:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:2\" href=\"/Psalms.144.2\">144:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.13\">Is 57:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מגן הוא ל(כל ה)חוסים בו</span> <em>escudo é ele para</em> (<em>todos</em>) <em>os que nele buscam refúgio</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.31\">2 S 22:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:31\" href=\"/Psalms.18.31\">ψ 18:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.5\">Pr 30:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ׳</span> provavelmente deve ser suprido pelo menos no pensamento: <span dir=\"rtl\">מושׁיע חוסים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:7\" href=\"/Psalms.17.7\">ψ 17:7</a> <em>salvador dos que buscam refúgio</em> (em ti); <span dir=\"rtl\">חסה במותו צדיק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.32\">Pr 14:32</a> <em>um justo em sua morte busca refúgio</em> (em Yahweh), <span dir=\"rtl\">בשׁם י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:12\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.12\">Zp 3:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בצל כנפיךָ</span> <em>à sombra de tuas asas</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:8\" href=\"/Psalms.36.8\">ψ 36:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:2\" href=\"/Psalms.57.2\">57:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בסתר כנפיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:5\" href=\"/Psalms.61.5\">ψ 61:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תחת כנפיו</span> <em>sob suas asas</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:4\" href=\"/Psalms.91.4\">ψ 91:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:12\" href=\"/Ruth.2.12\">Ru 2:12</a>.",
