      "preview": "מַחְסֶה: refúgio, abrigo.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֶה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <sup>Pr 14:26</sup> <strong>refúgio, abrigo</strong>;—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מַ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:2\" href=\"/Psalms.46.2\">ψ 46:2</a> + 2 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֵּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.17\">Is 28:17</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:8\" href=\"/Psalms.62.8\">ψ 62:8</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲסִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:7\" href=\"/Psalms.71.7\">ψ 71:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.17\">Je 17:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֵּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 14:6\" href=\"/Psalms.14.6\">ψ 14:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֵּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">Is 28:15</a>;—<em>abrigo:</em><br><strong>a.</strong>  da chuva e da tempestade <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.6\">Is 4:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  do perigo <span dir=\"rtl\">סְלָעִים מַחְסֶּה לַשְׁפַנִּים</span> <em>rochas, refúgio para os híraxes</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:18\" href=\"/Psalms.104.18\">ψ 104:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מחסה כזב</span> <em>refúgio de falsidade</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.17\">Is 28:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כזב מחסנוּ</span> <em>a falsidade é nosso refúgio</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">Is 28:15</a>; alhures de Deus como refúgio de seu povo <a data-ref=\"Psalms 14:6\" href=\"/Psalms.14.6\">ψ 14:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:2\" href=\"/Psalms.46.2\">46:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:4\" href=\"/Psalms.61.4\">61:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:8\" href=\"/Psalms.62.8\">62:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:9\" href=\"/Psalms.62.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:7\" href=\"/Psalms.71.7\">71:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:28\" href=\"/Psalms.73.28\">73:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:2\" href=\"/Psalms.91.2\">91:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:9\" href=\"/Psalms.91.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:22\" href=\"/Psalms.94.22\">94:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:6\" href=\"/Psalms.142.6\">142:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.26\">Pr 14:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.17\">Je 17:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:16\" href=\"/Joel.4.16\">Jo 4:16</a>.",
