      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֹר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] <strong>necessidade, coisa necessária, pobreza</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.24\">Pr 11:24</a> + 6 vezes; construto <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:10\" href=\"/Judges.18.10\">Ju 18:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:19\" href=\"/Judges.19.19\">19:19</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסוֹרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:20\" href=\"/Judges.19.20\">Ju 19:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֹרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.11\">Pr 6:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֹרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.8\">Dt 15:8</a>; plural com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֹרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.34\">Pr 24:34</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>necessidade</em> = <em>coisa necessária</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּי מַחְסֹרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.8\">Dt 15:8</a> <em>o suficiente para sua necessidade</em> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁר יֶחְסַר לוֹ</span>, cf. verbo <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָסֵר²\" href=\"/BDB,_חָסֵר²\", dir=\"rtl\">חָסֵר</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־מ׳ עָלָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:20\" href=\"/Judges.19.20\">Ju 19:20</a> <em>toda a tua necessidade</em> fique <em>a meu cargo</em> (para que eu a supra).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>falta, carência</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין מ׳ כָּל־דָּבָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:10\" href=\"/Judges.18.10\">Ju 18:10</a> <em>nenhuma falta de coisa alguma</em>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:19\" href=\"/Judges.19.19\">19:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:10\" href=\"/Psalms.34.10\">ψ 34:10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  em geral, <em>necessidade, pobreza</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.11\">Pr 6:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵאשׁ</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.34\">24:34</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵישׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.24\">11:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.23\">14:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.5\">21:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.16\">22:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.27\">28:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.17\">21:17</a> <em>um homem de pobreza</em>.",
