      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָפַז</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: estar em trepidação, pressa ou alarme (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَفَزَ</span> <em>apressar, incitar, impelir</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפּוֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:23\" href=\"/Job.40.23\">Jb 40:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְפְּזוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.3\">Dt 20:3</a>; infinitivo construto com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחָפְזִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:23\" href=\"/Psalms.31.23\">ψ 31:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:11\" href=\"/Psalms.116.11\">116:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחָפְזָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.4\">2 S 4:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחָפְזָם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.15\">2 K 7:15</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵחָֽפְזֵם</span>);— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>estar apressado</em> ou <em>alarmado</em>, de fuga apressada <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.4\">2 S 4:4</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.15\">2 K 7:15</a>; infinitivo com ב = substantivo, <em>em meu alarme</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:23\" href=\"/Psalms.31.23\">ψ 31:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:11\" href=\"/Psalms.116.11\">116:11</a>; <strong>2.</strong>  <em>estar alarmado</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.3\">Dt 20:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תיראו</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 40:23\" href=\"/Job.40.23\">Jb 40:23</a> (do hipopótamo)<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶחְפָּ֑זוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:6\" href=\"/Psalms.48.6\">ψ 48:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְהֲלוּ</span>) <em>afastar-se apressadamente em alarme;</em> assim imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָפֵז֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:7\" href=\"/Psalms.104.7\">ψ 104:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יְנוּסוּן</span>); infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵחָֽפְזֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.15\">2 K 7:15</a> Kt, ver acima; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶחְפָּז</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.26\">1 S 23:26</a> <em>apressado</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ויהי דוד נ׳ ללכת</span> <em>e Davi apressou-se a partir</em>.",
