      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָפֵץ</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo</strong> verbal <strong>que se deleita em, que tem prazer em</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:5\" href=\"/Psalms.5.5\">ψ 5:5</a> + 4 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפֵצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:1\" href=\"/Malachi.3.1\">Mal 3:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.11\">Ne 1:11</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפֵצֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:27\" href=\"/Psalms.35.27\">ψ 35:27</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶפְצֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:2\" href=\"/Psalms.111.2\">ψ 111:2</a>; feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפֵצָ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.9\">1 Ch 28:9</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>do homem</em>, com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:13\" href=\"/Psalms.34.13\">ψ 34:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:27\" href=\"/Psalms.35.27\">35:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:1\" href=\"/Malachi.3.1\">Mal 3:1</a>; com infinitivo <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.11\">Ne 1:11</a>; absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחָפֵץ</span> <em>quem quer que desejasse</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.33\">1 K 13:33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אם חפץ אתה</span> <em>se te agrada</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.6\">1 K 21:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ חֲפֵצָה</span> <em>alma disposta</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.9\">1 Ch 28:9</a>; plural construto antes de substantivos absolutos <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:22\" href=\"/Psalms.35.22\">ψ 35:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:15\" href=\"/Psalms.40.15\">40:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 70:3\" href=\"/Psalms.70.3\">70:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּרוּשִׁים לְכָל־חֶפְצֵיהֶם</span> <em>estudadas por todos os que nelas têm prazer</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:2\" href=\"/Psalms.111.2\">ψ 111:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>de Deus</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא אֵל־חָפֵץ רֶשַׁע אַתָּה</span> <em>tu não és um Deus que tem prazer na maldade</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:5\" href=\"/Psalms.5.5\">ψ 5:5</a>.",
