      "preview": "חָפַר: cavar, procurar.",
      "html": "† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָפַר</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: cavar, procurar (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَفَرَ</span> <em>idem;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܦܰܪ</span>, <em>idem;</em> hebraico pós-bíblico <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵפֶר</span> <em>ato de cavar</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:29\" href=\"/Job.39.29\">Jb 39:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָפַרְתָּ֫</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:18\" href=\"/Job.11.18\">Jb 11:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָפַרְתָּ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.14\">Dt 23:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפַרְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:30\" href=\"/Genesis.21.30\">Gn 21:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽפְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:18\" href=\"/Genesis.26.18\">Gn 26:18</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָפָ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:32\" href=\"/Genesis.26.32\">Gn 26:32</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפָרוּהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:18\" href=\"/Genesis.26.18\">Gn 26:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:22\" href=\"/Genesis.26.22\">22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפִּרֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:16\" href=\"/Psalms.7.16\">ψ 7:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.7\">Je 13:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפְּדוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:21\" href=\"/Job.39.21\">Jb 39:21</a> (mas ler <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפֹּר</span>, assim 𝔊 𝔙 𝔖 Di) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.22\">Dt 1:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:19\" href=\"/Genesis.26.19\">Gn 26:19</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְפְּרֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:21\" href=\"/Job.3.21\">Jb 3:21</a>; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:2\" href=\"/Joshua.2.2\">Jos 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:3\" href=\"/Joshua.2.3\">3</a> + <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.20\">Is 2:20</a> (cf. abaixo); particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹפֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.8\">Ec 10:8</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>cavar:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  um poço, com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:30\" href=\"/Genesis.21.30\">Gn 21:30</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:15\" href=\"/Genesis.26.15\">26:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:18\" href=\"/Genesis.26.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:19\" href=\"/Genesis.26.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:21\" href=\"/Genesis.26.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:22\" href=\"/Genesis.26.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:32\" href=\"/Genesis.26.32\">32</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a> (E); cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:24\" href=\"/Exodus.7.24\">Ex 7:24</a> (E); <em>cavar</em> (um buraco, implícito como objeto) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.14\">Dt 23:14</a>; uma cova, com propósito hostil, como laço ou armadilha, figura de plano malicioso, com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:16\" href=\"/Psalms.7.16\">ψ 7:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּרָה</span>); assim com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">גומץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.8\">Ec 10:8</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ לְנַפְשִׁי [שַׁחַת]</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:7\" href=\"/Psalms.35.7\">ψ 35:7</a>; do cavalo, <em>cavar</em>, isto é, <em>escarvar</em> o solo, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפֹּר בָּעֵמֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:21\" href=\"/Job.39.21\">Jb 39:21</a> (ler assim, ver acima) <em>ele escarva no vale</em> (cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَافِرٌ</span> <em>casco</em>). <strong>b.</strong>  <em>cavar</em> em busca de algo oculto, com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Job 3:21\" href=\"/Job.3.21\">Jb 3:21</a> (figura de anseio pela morte), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.7\">Je 13:7</a> (nenhum objeto expresso) <strong>2.</strong>  <em>procurar, investigar, explorar</em>, com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:2\" href=\"/Joshua.2.2\">Jos 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:3\" href=\"/Joshua.2.3\">3</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.22\">Dt 1:22</a>; da águia, <em>procurar</em> alimento, com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אֹכֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:29\" href=\"/Job.39.29\">Jb 39:29</a>, com especial referência à visão aguçada (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרָחוֹק עֵינָיו יַבִּיטוּ</span>); assim = <em>procurar</em> ou <em>olhar cuidadosamente ao redor</em> antes de repousar <a data-ref=\"Job 11:18\" href=\"/Job.11.18\">Jb 11:18</a> (sem objeto).—<span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְפֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.20\">Is 2:20</a> ver <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חֲפַרְפָּרָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲפַרְפָּרָה\">חֲפַרְפָּרָה</a> abaixo.",
