      "preview": "חָפֵר: ficar acanhado, envergonhado.",
      "html": "† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָפֵר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: ficar acanhado, envergonhado (</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲפַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.5\">Pr 13:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְפְּרָנָא</span> <em>aquele que causa vergonha</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.26\">Pr 19:26</a>; siríaco <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܦܰܪ</span>, especialmente Aph. <em>envergonhar-se, ser envergonhado;</em> árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">خَفَرَ</span> / <span dir=\"rtl\">خَفِرَ</span> <em>ser acanhado</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">خَفِرٌ</span> <em>tímido, acanhado;</em> etiópico ኀፈረ: <em>envergonhar-se, corar</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito 3.ª fem. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽפְרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.12\">Je 50:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָֽפְרָה</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.23\">Is 24:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָפֵ֑רָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.9\">Je 15:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽפְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:24\" href=\"/Psalms.71.24\">ψ 71:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָֽפְרוּ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:7\" href=\"/Micah.3.7\">Mi 3:7</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:4\" href=\"/Psalms.35.4\">ψ 35:4</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחְפָּ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:6\" href=\"/Psalms.34.6\">ψ 34:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֶּחְפָּ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:20\" href=\"/Job.6.20\">Jb 6:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְפְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.29\">Is 1:29</a>;—<em>ficar acanhado, envergonhado</em>, dito do rosto <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:6\" href=\"/Psalms.34.6\">ψ 34:6</a> (evitado por olhar para <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); alhures sempre ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹשׁ</span>, dos inimigos da justiça <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:24\" href=\"/Psalms.71.24\">ψ 71:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:4\" href=\"/Psalms.35.4\">35:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:26\" href=\"/Psalms.35.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:15\" href=\"/Psalms.40.15\">40:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 70:3\" href=\"/Psalms.70.3\">70:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:18\" href=\"/Psalms.83.18\">83:18</a>; de idólatras <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.29\">Is 1:29</a>; adivinhos <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:7\" href=\"/Micah.3.7\">Mi 3:7</a>; da angustiada Jerusalém <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.9\">Je 15:9</a>; assim da Babilônia <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.12\">50:12</a>; da lua <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.23\">Is 24:23</a>; <em>ser envergonhado</em> (decepção), de caravanas em busca de água <a data-ref=\"Job 6:20\" href=\"/Job.6.20\">Jb 6:20</a>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחְפִּיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.9\">Is 33:9</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְפִּיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.5\">Pr 13:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְפִּ֫ירִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.4\">Is 54:4</a>; <em>particípio</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְפִּיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.26\">Pr 19:26</a>;—<em>manifestar vergonha</em>, figura do Líbano <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.9\">Is 33:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קָמַ֑ל</span> ‘ressequido’ Che); de Israel <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.4\">Is 54:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹשׁ</span> Qal); de um filho que não cumpre seus deveres filiais, <em>causar vergonha</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.26\">Pr 19:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵבִישׁ</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.5\">Pr 13:5</a> dos ímpios (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יבאישׁ</span>: ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, בְּאֹשׁ\" href=\"/BDB,_בְּאֹשׁ\", dir=\"rtl\">באשׁ</a> <strong>Hiph.</strong> acima, p. 93).",
