      "preview": "חָצַב: talhar, escavar, fender.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָצַב</span>], <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצֵב</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: talhar, escavar, fender (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצַב</span>; SI<sup>4.6</sup> particípio plural <span dir=\"rtl\">החצבם</span>; cf. fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">מחצב</span> = hebraico <em>idem</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.2\">Is 5:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽצְבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.1\">Pr 9:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצַבְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:5\" href=\"/Hosea.6.5\">Ho 6:5</a>, etc.; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְצֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.10\">2 Ch 26:10</a>; 2.ª masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְצֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.9\">Dt 8:9</a>; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְצֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.13\">Je 2:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְצוֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.2\">1 Ch 22:2</a>; particípio ativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹצֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.15\">Is 10:15</a> + 4 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹצְבִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.16\">Is 22:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹצְבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.2\">1 Ch 22:2</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹצְבֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.13\">2 K 12:13</a>; passivo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצוּבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.11\">Dt 6:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.25\">Ne 9:25</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>escavar</em>, (<em>cavar</em>), lagar <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶקֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.2\">Is 5:2</a>; sepulcro <span dir=\"rtl\">(קֶבֶר)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.16\">Is 22:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; cisternas <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.11\">Dt 6:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.10\">2 Ch 26:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.25\">Ne 9:25</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.13\">Je 2:13</a>; de mineração <span dir=\"rtl\">מהרריה תַּח׳ נחשׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.9\">Dt 8:9</a> <em>de seus montes poderás extrair cobre</em>. <strong>2.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>talhar</em> pedra <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.2\">1 Ch 22:2</a>; metáfora de colunas <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.1\">Pr 9:1</a> (sujeito: sabedoria); alhures particípio, <em>talhador</em> de pedra <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.13\">2 K 12:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.2\">1 Ch 22:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.15\">15</a> (ver SI<sup>4.6</sup> acima); provavelmente <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.29\">1 K 5:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.1\">2 Ch 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.17\">17</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בָּהָר</span> ver Be), cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">24:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:7\" href=\"/Ezra.3.7\">Ezr 3:7</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  aparentemente <em>cortar madeira</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.15\">Is 10:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בוֹ</span> (isto é, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגַרְזֶן</span>). <strong>3.</strong>  metaforicamente <em>despedaçar</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:5\" href=\"/Hosea.6.5\">Ho 6:5</a>, figura de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> atacando o povo por intermédio dos profetas (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲרַגְתִּים</span>); <em>dividir, fender</em>, sujeito: voz de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:7\" href=\"/Psalms.29.7\">ψ 29:7</a>, objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">להבות אשׁ</span>, isto é, o trovão de sua voz envia relâmpagos bifurcados (mas quanto ao texto, cf. Che e nota crítica).<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָצְבוּן</span> <em>ser cortado, talhado, gravado</em> (palavras em rocha) <a data-ref=\"Job 19:24\" href=\"/Job.19.24\">Jb 19:24</a>.<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻצַּבְתֶּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.1\">Is 51:1</a>, figurado, <em>talhado</em> da rocha (da origem de Israel; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נֻקַּר</span>).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצֶ֫בֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.9\">Is 51:9</a> <em>despedaçar</em> = <strong>Qal 3</strong>, figura da destruição de <span dir=\"rtl\">רהב</span> = Egito (cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:11\" href=\"/Psalms.89.11\">ψ 89:11</a>).",
