      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִי</span></big><sub>123</sub>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <sup>Nu 12:12</sup> <strong>metade (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">חצי</span>; quanto à formação, ver Lag <sup>BN 113</sup><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.25\">1 K 3:25</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֵ֑צִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.7\">1 K 10:7</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.21\">16:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָחֵ֔צִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:42\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.42\">Ez 40:42</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָחֵצִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:7\" href=\"/Daniel.12.7\">Dn 12:7</a> + 13 vezes (geralmente com Pashta ou Tiphcha), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּחֵ֖צִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.4\">2 S 10:4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.4\">1 Ch 19:4</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:29\" href=\"/Exodus.12.29\">Ex 12:29</a> + 84 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶצְיוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:4\" href=\"/Exodus.38.4\">Ex 38:4</a> + 7 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:33\" href=\"/Joshua.8.33\">Jos 8:33</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהַחֶצְיוֹ</span> (mas o artigo é suspeito, ver Ges<sup>§ 127 R 3, 4</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶצְיָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.38\">Ne 3:38</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶצְיֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.3\">2 S 18:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶצְיָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.8\">Zc 14:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 2 vezes—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>metade</em> de qualquer coisa:—sangue da oferta <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:6\" href=\"/Exodus.24.6\">Ex 24:6</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (JE), barba <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.4\">2 S 10:4</a>, um him <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:9\" href=\"/Numbers.15.9\">Nu 15:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:10\" href=\"/Numbers.15.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:14\" href=\"/Numbers.28.14\">28:14</a> (P); cortina <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:12\" href=\"/Exodus.26.12\">Ex 26:12</a> (P); semana <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ השׁבוע</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:27\" href=\"/Daniel.9.27\">Dn 9:27</a> etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אַמָּה</span> <em>meio côvado</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:16\" href=\"/Exodus.26.16\">Ex 26:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:21\" href=\"/Exodus.36.21\">36:21</a> (P) +; especialmente <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ שׁבט</span> <em>meia tribo</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:33\" href=\"/Numbers.32.33\">Nu 32:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:13\" href=\"/Numbers.34.13\">34:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:14\" href=\"/Numbers.34.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:15\" href=\"/Numbers.34.15\">15</a> (P) +; metade do povo <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.3\">2 S 18:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:41\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.41\">19:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.21\">1 K 16:21</a><sup>(×3)</sup> +, etc. assim <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַמְּנֻחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:52\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.52\">1Ch 2:52</a> e <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַמָּנַחְתִּי</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:54\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.54\">54</a> (ver Be e <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָנַ֫חַת\" href=\"/BDB,_מָנַ֫חַת\", dir=\"rtl\">מָנַחַת</a> sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, נוּחַ\" href=\"/BDB,_נוּחַ\", dir=\"rtl\">נוח</a>).—Quanto a <span dir=\"rtl\">כבחצי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.14\">1 S 14:14</a>, ver We Dr.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>meio</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הלילה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:29\" href=\"/Exodus.12.29\">Ex 12:29</a> (J) <em>meia-noite</em>, assim <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:3\" href=\"/Judges.16.3\">Ju 16:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:8\" href=\"/Ruth.3.8\">Ru 3:8</a>; de vestes <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.4\">2 S 10:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.4\">1 Ch 19:4</a>; altar <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:5\" href=\"/Exodus.27.5\">Ex 27:5</a>; do monte das Oliveiras <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.4\">Zc 14:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ יָמַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:25\" href=\"/Psalms.102.25\">ψ 102:25</a> <em>o meio de meus dias</em> (quando apenas metade deles passou), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.11\">Je 17:11</a>.",
