      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִית</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: metade, meio</strong>—construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:13\" href=\"/Exodus.30.13\">Ex 30:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 8 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:30\" href=\"/Numbers.31.30\">Nu 31:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:47\" href=\"/Numbers.31.47\">47</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִיתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:23\" href=\"/Exodus.30.23\">Ex 30:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִיתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.13\">Lv 6:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲצִיתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:29\" href=\"/Numbers.31.29\">Nu 31:29</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>metade</em> de um siclo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:13\" href=\"/Exodus.30.13\">Ex 30:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:15\" href=\"/Exodus.30.15\">15</a> cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:23\" href=\"/Exodus.30.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:26\" href=\"/Exodus.38.26\">38:26</a>; da farinha para oferta <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.13\">Lv 6:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, de despojos <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:29\" href=\"/Numbers.31.29\">Nu 31:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:30\" href=\"/Numbers.31.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:42\" href=\"/Numbers.31.42\">42</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:47\" href=\"/Numbers.31.47\">47</a>; de tribo <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:25\" href=\"/Joshua.21.25\">Jos 21:25</a> (todos P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.46\">1 Ch 6:46</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:55\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.55\">55</a>; de carros <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.9\">1 K 16:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>meio</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ היּוֹם</span>=<em>meio-dia</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.3\">Ne 8:3</a> (cf. <em>meia-noite</em>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָצוֹת\" href=\"/BDB,_חָצוֹת\", dir=\"rtl\">חָצוֹת</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲצִי\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲצִי\", dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִי</a> <strong>2</strong>).",
