      "preview": "חֵץ²: flecha.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵץ</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <sup>1 S 20:20</sup> flecha, principalmente poético e profético <strong>(</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲצִי\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲצִי\", dir=\"rtl\">חֵצִי</a> acima sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָצָה\" href=\"/BDB,_חָצָה\", dir=\"rtl\">חצה</a><strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:5\" href=\"/Psalms.91.5\">ψ 91:5</a> + 9 vezes + <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">1 S 17:7</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ</span>, ver este); construto <em>idem</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.17\">2 K 13:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:6\" href=\"/Job.34.6\">Jb 34:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:8\" href=\"/Psalms.58.8\">ψ 58:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.14\">Zc 9:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:2\" href=\"/Psalms.11.2\">ψ 11:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:4\" href=\"/Psalms.64.4\">64:4</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:23\" href=\"/Genesis.49.23\">Gn 49:23</a> + 17 vezes + <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:38\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.38\">1 S 20:38</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫צִי</span>, ver este) + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.15\">2 S 22:15</a> (< <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצָּיו</span> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:15\" href=\"/Psalms.18.15\">ψ 18:15</a>); construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:4\" href=\"/Job.6.4\">Jb 6:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 120:4\" href=\"/Psalms.120.4\">ψ 120:4</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.16\">Ez 5:16</a> (Co <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצַּי</span> cf. 𝔊 𝔖 Hi); <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצַּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.23\">Dt 32:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:42\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.42\">42</a> (<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.16\">Ez 5:16</a> ver acima), <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצֶּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:3\" href=\"/Psalms.38.3\">ψ 38:3</a> + 4 vezes <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצָצֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:18\" href=\"/Psalms.77.18\">77:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חִצָּיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.28\">Is 5:28</a> + 5 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  literalmente, disparada de arco pela mão <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.20\">1 S 20:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.21\">21</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.22\">22</a> (𝔊 We singular, isto é, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֵצִי</span>, no versículo <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.22\">22</a>, ver também Dr) versículo <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.36\">36</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:38\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.38\">38</a> Qr <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:32\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.32\">2 K 19:32</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:33\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.33\">Is 37:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.28\">Is 5:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.24\">7:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.9\">Je 50:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.11\">51:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.3\">Ez 39:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.2\">1 Ch 12:2</a>; disparada de máquina de guerra <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.15\">2 Ch 26:15</a>; empregada em adivinhação <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.26\">Ez 21:26</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.15\">2 K 13:15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.18\">18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲלֵי חִצִּים</span> = arqueiros <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:23\" href=\"/Genesis.49.23\">Gn 49:23</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  figuradamente, das armas de Israel <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:8\" href=\"/Numbers.24.8\">Nu 24:8</a>, do rei (messiânico) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:6\" href=\"/Psalms.45.6\">ψ 45:6</a>, dos juízos de Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.23\">Dt 32:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:42\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.42\">42</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:4\" href=\"/Job.6.4\">Jb 6:4</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲצִי\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲצִי\", dir=\"rtl\">חִצִּי</a> = <em>minha ferida</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:6\" href=\"/Job.34.6\">34:6</a>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:14\" href=\"/Psalms.7.14\">ψ 7:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:3\" href=\"/Psalms.38.3\">38:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:3\" href=\"/Psalms.58.3\">58:3</a> (mas quanto ao texto, cf. Che<sup>crit. n.</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:8\" href=\"/Psalms.64.8\">64:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 120:4\" href=\"/Psalms.120.4\">120:4</a> (? cf. Che); ainda <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.23\">Pr 7:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:12\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.12\">La 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.16\">Ez 5:16</a>; em teofania <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:15\" href=\"/Psalms.18.15\">ψ 18:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.15\">2 S 22:15</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:11\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.11\">Hb 3:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.14\">Zc 9:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:18\" href=\"/Psalms.77.18\">ψ 77:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:6\" href=\"/Psalms.144.6\">144:6</a>; da violência dos ímpios <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:2\" href=\"/Psalms.11.2\">ψ 11:2</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:5\" href=\"/Psalms.91.5\">91:5</a>, sob figura de dentes de leão <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:5\" href=\"/Psalms.57.5\">ψ 57:5</a>; de suas palavras <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:4\" href=\"/Psalms.64.4\">ψ 64:4</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.18\">Pr 25:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.8\">Je 9:8</a>; símile da força e eficácia provenientes dos próprios filhos, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 127:4\" href=\"/Psalms.127.4\">ψ 127:4</a>; das palavras de um enganador <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.18\">Pr 26:18</a>; metáfora do servo de <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בָּרוּר י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.2\">Is 49:2</a>.—Em <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">1 S 17:7</a> ler <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ</span> (em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵץ</span>) como Qr e ‖ <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.19\">2 S 21:19</a> = <em>a haste;</em> ver <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עֵץ²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵץ²\">עֵץ</a>; assim Klo Dr",
