      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַצֲצֹן תָּמָר</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <em>da palmeira</em><strong>)</strong>;—habitação de amorreus <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:7\" href=\"/Genesis.14.7\">Gn 14:7</a>, 𝔊 Ασασαν Θαμαρ; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַצֲצוֹן תָּמָר הִיא עֵין גֶּ֑דִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.2\">2 Ch 20:2</a> base de operações de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַם</span> (ler <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱדוֹם</span>) contra Judá (ver Jos<sup>Ant.</sup>. <sup>ix, 1, 2</sup>); situava-se no lado ocidental do mar Morto (ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵין גֶּ֫דִי\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵין גֶּ֫דִי\", dir=\"rtl\">עֵין גֶּ֫דִי</a>); ver Rob<sup>BR i, 500–509</sup> Bd<sup>Pal. 143</sup> GASm<sup>Geogr. 269 ff.</sup>; o uádi <em>Ḥuṣāṣā</em> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">חצצן</span>?) fica a noroeste de En-Gedi GASm<sup>l.c.</sup> cf. Rob<sup>BR i, 506</sup> Bd<sup>Pal 14 (map)</sup>; GASm sugere também a possibilidade de encontrar aqui <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּמָר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.18\">1 K 9:18</a> Kt (= <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּדְמֹר</span> Qr e <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.4\">2 Ch 8:4</a>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.19\">Ez 47:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.28\">48:28</a> (ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, תָּמָר\" href=\"/BDB,_תָּמָר\", dir=\"rtl\">תָּמָר</a> nome próprio de lugar).",
