      "html": "II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָצֵר</span></big><sub>46</sub><big>]</big>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <sup>Ne 11:25</sup> <strong>morada fixa, povoado, aldeia (</strong>Lag<sup>l.c.</sup><strong>)</strong>—sempre plural, absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצֵרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:8\" href=\"/Joshua.19.8\">Jos 19:8</a> + 5 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חַצְרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.16\">1 Ch 9:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.28\">Ne 12:28</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצֵרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:12\" href=\"/Joshua.21.12\">Jos 21:12</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַצְרֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.33\">1 Ch 4:33</a> + 6 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַצְרֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:23\" href=\"/Joshua.13.23\">Jos 13:23</a> + 24 vezes; Josué;—<br><strong>a.</strong>  povoados dos ismaelitas <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:16\" href=\"/Genesis.25.16\">Gn 25:16</a> (P; ‖<span dir=\"rtl\">טִירוֹת</span> <em>círculos</em> de tendas); de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַוִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.23\">Dt 2:23</a>; de Quedar <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.11\">Is 42:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרִים</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּתֵּי הַחֲצֵרִים אֲשֶׁר אֵין־לָהֶם חֹמָה סָבִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.31\">Lv 25:31</a> (H), <em>casas das aldeias que não têm muro ao redor;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲרַב חֲצֵרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:8\" href=\"/Psalms.10.8\">ψ 10:8</a> <em>esconderijo</em>(<em>s</em>) <em>de aldeias</em> (isto é, onde o opressor, como animal selvagem, espreita a oportunidade de atacar os indefesos). Geralmente<br><strong>b.</strong>  como dependências de cidades <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:46\" href=\"/Joshua.15.46\">Jos 15:46</a>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֹתֶיהָ</span> (ver acima <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, בַּת\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_בַּת\", dir=\"rtl\">בַּת</a> <strong>4</strong> p. 123) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:45\" href=\"/Joshua.15.45\">Jos 15:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:47\" href=\"/Joshua.15.47\">47</a><sup>(</sup>×2<sup>)</sup> (todos JE?); <span dir=\"rtl\">וְכָל־הַח׳ אֲשֶׁר סְבִיבוֹת הֶעָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:8\" href=\"/Joshua.19.8\">19:8</a> (P), também <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:12\" href=\"/Joshua.21.12\">21:12</a> (P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.41\">1 Ch 6:41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.29\">Ne 12:29</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:23\" href=\"/Joshua.13.23\">Jos 13:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:28\" href=\"/Joshua.13.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:32\" href=\"/Joshua.15.32\">15:32</a> + 23 vezes em Josué (todos P), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.25\">Ne 11:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.30\">30</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנוֹת</span> versículos <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.27\">27</a> etc.), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.28\">12:28</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  aldeias, não em contraste com cidades (cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.11\">Is 42:11</a> acima) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.16\">1 Ch 9:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.25\">25</a> (todas de levitas).<br><strong>d.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> aparentemente inclui todos os povoados fora de Jerusalém <span dir=\"rtl\">הַח׳ בִּשְׂדֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.25\">Ne 11:25</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> em nomes próprios de lugar, ver abaixo (e ver Bla sobre <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:20-32\" href=\"/Joshua.15.20-32\">Jos 15:20–32</a>).",
