      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָצוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצֹר</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar (</strong>Lag<sup>BN 47 f.</sup><strong>)</strong>—𝔊 Ασωρ, etc.;<br><strong>1.</strong>  uma cidade real do norte de Canaã <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:1\" href=\"/Joshua.11.1\">Jos 11:1</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבִין מֶלֶךְ־ח׳</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:19\" href=\"/Joshua.12.19\">12:19</a>, e <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:2\" href=\"/Judges.4.2\">Ju 4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:17\" href=\"/Judges.4.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.9\">1 S 12:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:10\" href=\"/Joshua.11.10\">Jos 11:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:11\" href=\"/Joshua.11.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:13\" href=\"/Joshua.11.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:36\" href=\"/Joshua.19.36\">19:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.29\">2 K 15:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.15\">1 K 9:15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  lugares no Neguebe: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:23\" href=\"/Joshua.15.23\">Jos 15:23</a>. <strong>b. c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:25\" href=\"/Joshua.15.25\">Jos 15:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וחָצוֹר חֲדַתָּה וּקְרִיּוֹת חֶצְרוֹן הִיא חָצוֹר</span>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:33\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.33\">Ne 11:33</a> uma cidade benjamita, provavelmente = <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעַל חָצוֹר</span>, ver este.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְלְכוֹת חָצוֹר אֲשֶׁר הִכָּה נְבוּכַדְרֶאצַּו֯ר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.28\">Je 49:28</a>, cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.33\">33</a>, uma localidade árabe, ver Winer<sup>RW Hazor</sup> Gf Gie.—<span dir=\"rtl\">עֵין ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:37\" href=\"/Joshua.19.37\">Jos 19:37</a>, ver sob <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עַ֫יִן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עַ֫יִן\">עַיִן</a>.",
